    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Putting it all together, this looks most like stable recovery after the heart event. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let's get an echocardiogram, for follow-up. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture.",
