      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'll also refer you to cardiac rehabilitation. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:37",
      "end_timestamp": "04:52",
